      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of being an error is the most painful kind of self-judgment, and it's often the loudest voice in the quiet moments. If you are truly feeling like a burden, it is a sign that you are in deep pain, and that pain deserves to be addressed by a real, tangible solution. Please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate this overwhelming sense of worthlessness. There are people who want to help you find a different kind of value.",
